WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.426
Citizen tools.

2
00:00:01.426 --> 00:00:05.449
Work out land units, costs and inheritance shares.

3
00:00:05.449 --> 00:00:08.506
What you type never leaves your phone.

4
00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.034
Step 1.

5
00:00:10.034 --> 00:00:11.594
Open Citizen tools.

6
00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:14.548
Press Citizen tools in the top menu.

7
00:00:14.548 --> 00:00:18.734
There are three: land units, costs and inheritance.

8
00:00:19.688 --> 00:00:20.179
Step 2.

9
00:00:20.179 --> 00:00:22.071
Enter an amount and a unit.

10
00:00:22.071 --> 00:00:24.103
Open the Land unit converter.

11
00:00:24.103 --> 00:00:26.275
Type an amount, for example 10.

12
00:00:26.275 --> 00:00:28.938
Then pick a unit, for example decimal.

13
00:00:29.892 --> 00:00:30.382
Step 3.

14
00:00:30.382 --> 00:00:31.503
Read the result.

15
00:00:31.503 --> 00:00:35.354
The table below shows the amount in every unit at once.

16
00:00:35.354 --> 00:00:38.225
For example, 10 decimal is about 6 katha.
